// A piece of the project's work (today's items, ids kept, three digits at least: I-001, I-143). TITLE as opened; NOTE its note in the vault. Who
// works on it is said by `coord item start` (the `started` line); checks are opened under it (`coord ready --item`).
// Its close is held by the lead (a `hold`: owed, never delivered, never Silent), and answered when the work is done.
/// a piece of the project's work, closed by its lead when the work is done
kind item
  letter I 3
  form title: Text, note: Ref?
  result Done(why: Text) | Dropped(why: Text)
  pattern
    hold role lead close(title, note)
